{"symbol":"DRONACHRYA","yahoo":"DRONACHRYA.BO","bse":null,"isin":null,"name":"DroneAcharya Aerial Innovations Limited","sector":"Technology","industry":"Computer Hardware","website":"https://droneacharya.com","about":"DroneAcharya Aerial Innovations Limited provides drone training services in India. The company offers drone survey and mapping, drone surveillance and videography, precision spraying, hardware, software and firmware, drone delivery, and underwater inspection services; and terrestrial mapping, strategic planning, and bathymetric solutions. It provides training services, including drone pilot training; drone building; aerial cinematography; drone racing; phyton for geographic information system; geographic information system for drones; disaster management with drones; drone survey and mapping; and drone in agriculture. In addition, the company offers survey, spraying, first person view, and underwater drones; and reusable rocket launch vehicle solutions and cubesat products. Further, it provides maintenance services and management consultancy services. Additionally, the companies serves defense, infrastructure, energy, utilities, agriculture, education, urban planning, mining, security, oil and gas, water bodies, insurance, environment, forest, and disaster management industries. DroneAcharya Aerial Innovations Limited was incorporated in 2017 and is headquartered in Pune, India.","updated":"2026-09-26T06:19:25+00:00","quote":{"price":33.33,"prevClose":35.08,"marketCap":79.96,"high52":65.4,"low52":28.97,"pe":208.31,"bookValue":25.43,"dividendRate":0.0,"roe":0.64,"shares":2.3989,"insiders":35.47,"institutions":0.0},"prices":{"dates":["2022-12-23","2022-12-26","2022-12-27","2022-12-28","2022-12-29","2022-12-30","2023-01-02","2023-01-03","2023-01-04","2023-01-05","2023-01-06","2023-01-09","2023-01-10","2023-01-11","2023-01-12","2023-01-13","2023-01-16","2023-01-17","2023-01-18","2023-01-19","2023-01-20","2023-01-23","2023-01-24","2023-01-25","2023-01-27","